# Phy quiz content

Edit `quizzes/<slug>/js/quizData.js`. `npm run build:content` copies it to `public/`. Do not hand-edit `public/` or `dist/`.

Heat Ch.1, foundations: edit `quizData.js` directly. Optics chapters also use `quizData.js` for one-off questions. Do not re-run the Word extractors unless the teacher explicitly asks to re-import a docx.

## New topic

Append to `QUIZ_SECTIONS`:

```js
{ id: "latent-heat", label: "Latent heat", labelZh: "潛熱" }
```

Then add items whose `section` equals that `id`.

## New MCQ

Push onto `QUIZ_ITEMS`:

```js
{
  id: "lh-1",
  section: "latent-heat",
  difficulty: "Foundation", // Foundation | Standard | Applied
  stem: "English stem",
  stemZh: "繁體中文題目",
  options: [
    { key: "A", text: "Option A" },
    { key: "B", text: "Option B" },
    { key: "C", text: "Option C" },
    { key: "D", text: "Option D" },
  ],
  answer: "B",
  hint: "Brief explanation",
}
```

`id` must be unique in that quiz. Optional `image: { src, alt, caption }` with a file under that quiz's `assets/` folder.

Do not copy Chem `questions.json` (`ch` / `n` / string `options`) and do not copy `scripts/data/questions.json` (`en.q` / `a: 1`).

## Remove a topic

Delete those items from `QUIZ_ITEMS`, remove the `QUIZ_SECTIONS` row, then `npm run build:content`.
